DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nTony Dab
	as\, hailing from Staten Island\, is a rising star in the New York City st
	and-up scene. Known for his quick wit and relatable humor\, Tony has also 
	made a major name for himself in the world of social media\, collaborating
	 with influencers on TikTok and Instagram to create hilarious characters a
	nd viral sketches. \nHis ability to connect with audiences both online and
	 on stage makes him one of the most exciting comedians to watch in the com
	edy world right now. Tony’s comedy draws from his Staten Island roots and 
	New York City experiences\, delivering the kind of sharp\, street-smart hu
	mor that resonates with audiences everywhere. \nWith a rapidly growing fan
	base and a natural talent for both stand-up and character work\, Tony Daba
	s is building a career that is only going to get bigger. Don’t miss your c
	hance to see him live in San Antonio! \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wednesday\,
	 August 12\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM CDT\nDoors Open: 6:30 PM CDT\nVenue:
	 Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\nAddress: 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 7
	8216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event — Valid photo ID required\n Available wit
	h VIP ticket purchase\n\nAbout the Venue\nLaugh Out Loud Comedy Club is Sa
	n Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in 
	Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco — just inside the loop and only a 
	few miles from the airport. \nThe club features a full bar lounge where gu
	ests can grab a drink before the show\, and a comfortable showroom with fi
	rst-come\, first-served seating. Preferred Tables are located center stage
	 for the best views\, while General Admission tables are positioned on the
	 sides and wings. \nThere is a 2-item food or beverage minimum per person 
	once seated\, and an 18% service charge applies to all checks in the showr
	oom. Early arrival is strongly recommended to secure your preferred seatin
	g. \nWhat to Expect\nTony Dabas brings the energy of New York City comedy 
	to the San Antonio stage. His stand-up is fast-paced\, relatable\, and pac
	ked with the kind of sharp observations that make you laugh because they’r
	e so true. \n \nThis is a Wednesday night show at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Cl
	ub — the perfect mid-week pick-me-up. Grab your tickets now! \nTicket Info
	rmation\n\nGeneral Admission: $25 (+ fees)\nPreferred Seating: $35 (+ fees
	)\n $45 (+ fees)\nOrder Limit: 10 tickets per order\n\n\nOfficial TicketsR
	esale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission 
	if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll s
	ales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be requir
	ed for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/tony-dabas-live-at-laugh
	-out-loud-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
