	 (Main Room)\nAddress: 20110 Lower Union Street\, Brookfield\, WI 53045\nA
	ge Requirement: 21+ (Valid photo ID required)\nSeating: General admission\
	, first-come first-served (except groups and premium booths)\nTwo-Item Min
	imum: Required per person in the showroom \nAbout Matt Fulchiron\nMatt Ful
	chiron is a stand-up comedian known for his clever observations and energe
	tic stage presence. He has performed at comedy clubs and festivals across 
	the country\, building a loyal fanbase with his authentic and hilarious ma
	terial. His comedy blends everyday life experiences with sharp comedic tim
	ing that resonates with audiences of all backgrounds. \nWhat to Expect\n\n
	A full evening of stand-up comedy with Matt Fulchiron headlining\nSharp\, 
	witty material covering everyday life and relatable topics\nIntimate club 
	setting at Milwaukee Improv’s Main Room\nTwo-item minimum purchase per per
	son (food and drinks available)\n21+ event — bring valid photo ID\nNo phot
	ography or video recording during the performance\n\nVenue Information\nMi
	lwaukee Improv (Main Room) is located at 20110 Lower Union Street in Brook
	field\, Wisconsin\, just outside Milwaukee. The venue offers an intimate c
	omedy club atmosphere with excellent sightlines and a full food and drink 
	menu to enjoy during the show. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available
	 starting at $26.22\, with premium options up to $80.58. Secure your seats
