DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nGodfrey LIVE at Cobb’s Comedy Club\n \nEvent De
	tails\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:3
	0 PM)\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Franc
	isco\, CA 94133\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo I
	D\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person\nVIP: Front-of-House seating +
	 Post-Show Meet & Greet available \nAbout Godfrey\nGodfrey is a Nigerian-A
	merican stand-up comedian and actor best known for his explosive energy an
	d hilarious observations on culture\, race\, and everyday life. He has app
	eared on numerous TV shows and specials\, and his 2026 special “Rebel with
	 a Cause” has been a massive hit with fans. With over 67 upcoming shows on
	 his current tour\, Godfrey is one of the hottest comedians on the road ri
	ght now. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up from one of comedy’s mos
	t dynamic performers\nSharp cultural commentary and hilarious storytelling
	\nVIP option with post-show Meet & Greet\nIntimate club setting at one of 
	SF’s premier comedy venues\nFull bar and beverage service available\n18+ s
	how — valid photo ID required\n\nVenue Information\nCobb’s Comedy Club is 
	one of San Francisco’s most beloved comedy venues\, located at 915 Columbu
	s Avenue in the vibrant North Beach neighborhood. With a capacity of over 
	400\, it’s the perfect setting for a big-name comedy show. \nTicket Inform
	ation\nTickets start at $35. VIP tickets include front-of-house seating an
	d a post-show Meet & Greet. There is a 2 beverage minimum per person. Tick
	ets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale).
	 \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate link
	s. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no ex
	tra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Vali
	d photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/
	godfrey-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
