SUMMARY:Troy Bond LIVE at San Jose Improv
DTSTAMP:20260811T095930Z
DTSTART:20260813T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nTroy Bon
	d is a fast-rising stand-up comedian and writer based in New York City\, k
	nown for his sharp joke writing\, expert crowdwork\, and tongue-in-cheek c
	elebrity impressions. With over 3 million followers across social media pl
	atforms\, Troy has built one of the most engaged comedy audiences of his g
	eneration. \nAt just 27 years old\, Troy has already made a major mark on 
	the comedy world. He was selected for the prestigious 2023 Just for Laughs
	 New Faces of Comedy lineup — a showcase that has launched the careers of 
	Kevin Hart\, Taylor Tomlinson\, Kumail Nanjiani\, and many more. He began 
	performing stand-up at age 17 and has been selling out headlining shows ac
	ross the United States ever since. \nTroy’s comedy tackles everything from
	 capitalism and politics to superheroes and pop culture\, delivered with a
	 versatile comedic voice that resonates with audiences of all backgrounds.
	 He also co-hosts the BONDING podcast with fellow comedian Torey Cole\, wh
	ere the duo discuss comedy\, life\, and everything in between. \nEvent Det
	ails\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\nShow Time: 8:00 PM (Doors open 
	at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, CA 95113
	\nAge Restriction: 21+ (Valid photo ID required)\nContent: Adult language 
	and themes\nTwo-item minimum purchase required in the showroom\n\nAbout th
	e Venue\nThe San Jose Improv is one of the Bay Area’s most beloved comedy 
	clubs\, situated in the heart of downtown San Jose at 62 S Second St. As p
	art of the nationally recognized Improv Comedy Club chain\, the San Jose l
	ocation has been a launching pad and destination for the biggest names in 
	stand-up comedy. \nThe intimate venue seats approximately 250 guests in a 
	general admission\, first-come-first-served format\, with premium booth an
	d table options available for a more elevated experience. Every seat in th
	e house offers an excellent view of the stage\, making it one of the best 
	places in the Bay Area to catch live comedy up close. \nThe club features 
	a full bar and food menu\, with a mandatory two-item minimum per guest in 
	the showroom. Parking is available in nearby downtown San Jose garages and
	 street parking. The venue is conveniently located near public transit opt
	ions in the heart of downtown San Jose. \nWhat to Expect\nTroy Bond’s live
	 show is a high-energy\, fast-paced stand-up performance that showcases hi
	s exceptional joke-writing ability and natural stage charisma. Known for h
	is ability to work the crowd and adapt on the fly\, Troy delivers a show t
	hat feels both polished and spontaneous. \nExpect sharp observational humo
	r\, clever impressions\, and material that ranges from personal anecdotes 
	to broader cultural commentary. Troy’s youthful energy and precision comed
	y make him one of the most exciting live performers working today. This is
	 a 21+ event with adult-oriented material. \nSeating is general admission\
	, so arriving early is recommended to secure the best seats. Premium VIP b
	ooths and tables are available for purchase and include food and beverage 
	credits. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $31.14 – $101.65 (includes fee
	s) \nTickets are available through official channels and resale platforms.
	 Troy Bond shows sell out quickly — purchase early to secure your spot. \n
	\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We
	 earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra c
	ost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid pho
	to ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/troy-
	bond-live-at-san-jose-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/troy-bond-live-at-san-jose-improv/
LOCATION:San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, California\, 95113\,
	 United States
