SUMMARY:Ms. Pat LIVE at West Nyack Levity Live
DTSTAMP:20260811T095930Z
DTSTART:20260814T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n \nMs. Pat LI
	VE at West Nyack Levity Live\nGet ready for a night of unfiltered\, gut-bu
	sting comedy as Ms. Pat takes the stage at West Nyack Levity Live on Frida
	y\, August 14\, 2026. Known for her brutally honest storytelling and fearl
	ess humor\, Ms. Pat delivers a stand-up experience unlike any other. \nEve
	nt Details\n\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open a
	t 6:00 PM)\nVenue: West Nyack Levity Live\nAddress: 4210 Palisades Center 
	Dr A – 401\, West Nyack\, NY 10994\nTicket Prices: $37.17 – $107.72\nAge R
	estriction: 21+ event\n\nAbout Ms. Pat\nPatricia Williams\, better known a
	s Ms. Pat\, is a stand-up comedian\, actress\, and author who rose from a 
	turbulent upbringing in Atlanta to become one of the most compelling voice
	s in comedy. Her Netflix special Lottery Ticket and her hit BET+ sitcom Th
	e Ms. Pat Show have earned her a devoted fanbase. Her comedy is raw\, real
	\, and rooted in her extraordinary life story — from the streets to the st
	age. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect an evening of no-holds-barred stand-up comed
	y. Ms. Pat’s sets are known for their sharp wit\, personal anecdotes\, and
	 the kind of honesty that makes audiences laugh until they cry. This is a 
	21+ event with a two-item minimum purchase in the showroom. No photography
	\, videography\, or recording is permitted during the show. \nVenue Inform
	ation\nWest Nyack Levity Live is located inside the Palisades Center Mall 
	at 4210 Palisades Center Dr A – 401\, West Nyack\, NY 10994. Free parking 
	is available in the Palisades Center Mall parking lot. The venue features 
	general admission seating (first-come\, first-served) with the exception o
	f groups and premium booths. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $37.
	17 to $107.72. Grab your official tickets through TicketWeb or find resale
	 tickets on VividSeats: \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n \nThis post
	 contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to yo
	u.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/ms-pat-live-at-west-nyack-levity-li
	ve/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/ms-pat-live-at-west-nyack-levity-live/
LOCATION:West Nyack Levity Live\, 4210 Palisades Center Dr A - 401\, West N
	yack\, NY\, 10994\, USA
